---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Hauke Schnau — Software Developer</title>
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Instrument+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
		<style>
			*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

			:root {
				--bg: #050505;
				--card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
				--card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
				--text-primary: #f0eded;
				--text-secondary: #7a7a7a;
				--purple: #a855f7;
				--cyan: #06b6d4;
				--rose: #f43f5e;
				--emerald: #10b981;
				--font-heading: 'Syne', sans-serif;
				--font-body: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif;
				--font-mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
			}

			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

			body {
				background: var(--bg);
				color: var(--text-primary);
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				line-height: 1.7;
				overflow-x: hidden;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { font-family: var(--font-heading); line-height: 1.2; }

			/* Grain overlay */
			.grain-overlay {
				position: fixed;
				inset: 0;
				z-index: 1000;
				pointer-events: none;
				opacity: 0.022;
				background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
				background-repeat: repeat;
				background-size: 256px 256px;
			}

			/* Gradient orbs */
			.orb {
				position: fixed;
				border-radius: 50%;
				filter: blur(140px);
				opacity: 0.18;
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 0;
				will-change: transform;
			}
			.orb-1 {
				width: 600px; height: 600px;
				background: radial-gradient(circle, #7c3aed 0%, #a855f7 100%);
				top: -10%; left: -5%;
				animation: orbit1 28s ease-in-out infinite;
			}
			.orb-2 {
				width: 500px; height: 500px;
				background: radial-gradient(circle, #0ea5e9 0%, #06b6d4 100%);
				top: 30%; right: -10%;
				animation: orbit2 34s ease-in-out infinite;
			}
			.orb-3 {
				width: 450px; height: 450px;
				background: radial-gradient(circle, #f43f5e 0%, #e11d48 100%);
				bottom: 10%; left: 15%;
				animation: orbit3 22s ease-in-out infinite;
				opacity: 0.14;
			}
			.orb-4 {
				width: 400px; height: 400px;
				background: radial-gradient(circle, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
				bottom: 40%; right: 20%;
				animation: orbit4 38s ease-in-out infinite;
				opacity: 0.12;
			}

			@keyframes orbit1 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
				25% { transform: translate(80px, 60px) scale(1.05); }
				50% { transform: translate(40px, 120px) scale(0.95); }
				75% { transform: translate(-60px, 40px) scale(1.02); }
			}
			@keyframes orbit2 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
				25% { transform: translate(-70px, 80px) scale(0.97); }
				50% { transform: translate(-120px, 30px) scale(1.04); }
				75% { transform: translate(-40px, -60px) scale(0.98); }
			}
			@keyframes orbit3 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
				33% { transform: translate(100px, -50px) scale(1.06); }
				66% { transform: translate(-70px, -80px) scale(0.94); }
			}
			@keyframes orbit4 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
				20% { transform: translate(-60px, 40px) scale(1.03); }
				40% { transform: translate(50px, 90px) scale(0.96); }
				60% { transform: translate(80px, -30px) scale(1.05); }
				80% { transform: translate(-40px, -70px) scale(0.98); }
			}

			/* Floating particles */
			.particle {
				position: fixed;
				border-radius: 50%;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 1;
				will-change: transform;
			}
			.p1 { width: 3px; height: 3px; top: 12%; left: 20%; animation: drift1 24s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p2 { width: 2px; height: 2px; top: 25%; left: 70%; animation: drift2 30s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p3 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 40%; left: 40%; animation: drift3 20s ease-in-out infinite; opacity: 0.2; }
			.p4 { width: 2px; height: 2px; top: 55%; left: 85%; animation: drift1 26s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p5 { width: 3px; height: 3px; top: 70%; left: 15%; animation: drift2 32s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p6 { width: 2px; height: 2px; top: 80%; left: 55%; animation: drift3 28s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p7 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 15%; left: 90%; animation: drift1 22s ease-in-out infinite; opacity: 0.18; }
			.p8 { width: 2px; height: 2px; top: 35%; left: 10%; animation: drift2 36s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p9 { width: 3px; height: 3px; top: 60%; left: 65%; animation: drift3 25s ease-in-out infinite; }
			.p10 { width: 2px; height: 2px; top: 90%; left: 35%; animation: drift1 29s ease-in-out infinite; }

			@keyframes drift1 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); opacity: 0.15; }
				50% { transform: translate(30px, -20px); opacity: 0.3; }
			}
			@keyframes drift2 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); opacity: 0.1; }
				50% { transform: translate(-25px, 25px); opacity: 0.25; }
			}
			@keyframes drift3 {
				0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); opacity: 0.12; }
				50% { transform: translate(20px, 30px); opacity: 0.28; }
			}

			/* Glass card base */
			.glass {
				background: var(--card-bg);
				backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
				border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
				border-radius: 16px;
			}
			.glass-hover {
				transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
							box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
							border-color 0.4s ease;
			}
			.glass-hover:hover {
				transform: translateY(-4px);
				box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08), 0 0 60px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.06);
				border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
			}

			/* Gradient text */
			.gradient-text {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c084fc, #22d3ee);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
			}
			.gradient-text-rose {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #a855f7);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
			}

			/* Scroll indicator */
			.scroll-indicator {
				animation: scrollBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
			}
			@keyframes scrollBounce {
				0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.4; }
				50% { transform: translateY(10px); opacity: 0.8; }
			}

			/* Section animation */
			.reveal {
				opacity: 0;
				transform: translateY(40px);
				transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
							transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
			}
			.reveal.visible {
				opacity: 1;
				transform: translateY(0);
			}

			/* Sticky nav */
			.nav-glass {
				background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.6);
				backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
			}

			/* Pill tags */
			.pill {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 4px 12px;
				border-radius: 999px;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
			}
			.pill:hover {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				color: var(--text-primary);
				border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			}
			.pill-star {
				color: var(--purple);
				border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
				background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.06);
			}

			/* Timeline */
			.timeline-line {
				position: absolute;
				left: 16px;
				top: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				width: 1px;
				background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1));
			}
			.timeline-dot {
				position: absolute;
				left: 10px;
				top: 6px;
				width: 13px;
				height: 13px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #06b6d4);
				box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
				z-index: 2;
			}

			/* Placeholder preview */
			.preview-placeholder {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
				border-radius: 12px;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}
			.preview-placeholder::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 1px;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15));
				-webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
				mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
				-webkit-mask-composite: xor;
				mask-composite: exclude;
			}

			/* Gradient button */
			.btn-gradient {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 8px;
				padding: 14px 32px;
				border-radius: 12px;
				font-family: var(--font-heading);
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 1rem;
				color: white;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #06b6d4);
				border: none;
				cursor: pointer;
				transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.btn-gradient:hover {
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3), 0 0 60px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
			}

			/* Category glow colors */
			.glow-purple { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.04); }
			.glow-purple:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1), 0 4px 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.06); }
			.glow-cyan { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.04); }
			.glow-cyan:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1), 0 4px 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.06); }
			.glow-rose { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.04); }
			.glow-rose:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.1), 0 4px 30px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.06); }
			.glow-emerald { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04); }
			.glow-emerald:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), 0 4px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06); }

			/* Photo frames */
			.photo-frame {
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
				border-radius: 16px;
			}
			.photo-frame::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 1px;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2), rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.1));
				-webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
				mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
				-webkit-mask-composite: xor;
				mask-composite: exclude;
			}

			/* Section spacing */
			.section-gap { padding: 120px 0; }

			/* Content container */
			.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

			/* Blog date tag */
			.date-tag {
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				color: var(--purple);
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
			}

			/* Contact links */
			.contact-link {
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: color 0.3s ease;
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
			.contact-link:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }

			/* Layout utilities */
			.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
			.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
			.stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
			.stack-lg { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4rem; }
			.row { display: flex; align-items: center; }
			.wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
			.space-y > * + * { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
			.text-center { text-align: center; }

			/* Responsive */
			@media (max-width: 1024px) {
				.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
			}
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.section-gap { padding: 80px 0; }
				.orb { filter: blur(80px); opacity: 0.15; }
				.orb-1 { width: 350px; height: 350px; }
				.orb-2 { width: 300px; height: 300px; }
				.orb-3 { width: 250px; height: 250px; }
				.orb-4 { width: 200px; height: 200px; }
				.grid-3, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
				.photos-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
				.photos-grid .span-2 { grid-column: auto !important; grid-row: auto !important; }
				.project-row { flex-direction: column !important; }
				.project-preview { width: 100% !important; }
			}

			@media (max-width: 640px) {
				.container { padding: 0 16px; }
			}

			/* Value index number */
			.value-index {
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<!-- Grain overlay -->
		<div class="grain-overlay"></div>

		<!-- Gradient orbs -->
		<div class="orb orb-1"></div>
		<div class="orb orb-2"></div>
		<div class="orb orb-3"></div>
		<div class="orb orb-4"></div>

		<!-- Particles -->
		<div class="particle p1"></div>
		<div class="particle p2"></div>
		<div class="particle p3"></div>
		<div class="particle p4"></div>
		<div class="particle p5"></div>
		<div class="particle p6"></div>
		<div class="particle p7"></div>
		<div class="particle p8"></div>
		<div class="particle p9"></div>
		<div class="particle p10"></div>

		<!-- Navigation -->
		<nav class="nav-glass fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50">
			<div class="container" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 4rem;">
				<a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--text-primary); text-decoration: none;">
					Hauke Schnau
				</a>
				<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem;">
					<a href="#about" class="text-xs tracking-wide hidden md:inline" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">About</a>
					<a href="#stack" class="text-xs tracking-wide hidden md:inline" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">Stack</a>
					<a href="#projects" class="text-xs tracking-wide hidden md:inline" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">Projects</a>
					<a href="#career" class="text-xs tracking-wide hidden md:inline" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">Career</a>
					<a href="#contact" class="text-xs tracking-wide hidden md:inline" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">Contact</a>
					<a href="/" class="text-xs tracking-wide" style="color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#f0eded'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#7a7a7a'">← Back to designs</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center" style="padding-top: 80px;">
			<div class="container" style="opacity: 1;">
				<p class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6" style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-family: var(--font-mono);">Software Developer</p>
				<h1 class="gradient-text" style="font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 8rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05;">
					Hauke Schnau
				</h1>
				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-4" style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;">
					Crafting type-safe systems at the intersection of modern TypeScript and AI-native engineering
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm mb-10" style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-family: var(--font-mono);">
					📍 Hamburg / Bremen, Germany
				</p>
				<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
					<span class="pill">3+ Years Experience</span>
					<span class="pill">GPA 1.47</span>
					<span class="pill">Two Offers on the Table</span>
				</div>
				<div class="scroll-indicator" style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
						<path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- About -->
		<section id="about" class="section-gap relative z-10">
			<div class="container reveal">
				<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--purple); font-family: var(--font-mono);">01 — About</p>
				<h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-family: var(--font-heading);">
					<span class="gradient-text">Who I am</span>
				</h2>
				<div class="glass glass-hover" style="padding: 2rem 3rem; max-width: 56rem; border-radius: 24px;">
					<div class="space-y" style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9;">
						<p>I'm a twenty-three-year-old software developer who started shipping production code at nineteen. My path has taken me from building property management apps with Spring Boot, through Germany's largest comparison portal Check24 (where I earned their highest performance rating), to leading frontend development and architecture at Buildlinx.</p>
						<p>I think in types. TypeScript end-to-end — from database schemas through tRPC APIs to React components — because runtime errors should be compile-time errors. I live in the bleeding edge of the TS ecosystem: Effect TS for composable error handling, Zod for runtime validation, TanStack for state and routing.</p>
						<p>My development workflow is <span style="color: var(--text-primary);">AI-native</span>. Cursor, Claude, and OpenAI Codex aren't experiments — they're how I ship. My technical lead at Buildlinx was impressed by how concise my prompts are. That precision carries through to everything I build.</p>
						<p>Currently weighing two offers: <span style="color: var(--text-primary);">Check24 at ~63k</span> (Professional Developer) and <span style="color: var(--text-primary);">Buildlinx at 64k</span> (Software Developer with Architecture Responsibility). Looking for the environment where modern TypeScript, AI tooling, and engineering excellence aren't just tolerated — they're expected.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Tech Stack -->
		<section id="stack" class="section-gap relative z-10">
			<div class="container reveal">
				<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--cyan); font-family: var(--font-mono);">02 — Tech Stack</p>
				<h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-family: var(--font-heading);">
					<span class="gradient-text">Tools of the trade</span>
				</h2>
